                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game falls neatly under \"deceptively simple\" - I haven't played anything like it, so I don't really have a frame of reference. I would say that everything you do involves strategy. Employ the strategy correctly and you win. \n\nA few observations\n - Audio: The music will make same men mad and mad men sane. Turn it off... the rest is okay\n - Graphics: Artistically cohesive, I have definitely seen worse\n - Ship customization: Very bare-bones\n - The 4 tower defense sections feel out of place  \n - Replayability: Once you've won, I see no reason to play again\n\nThere are free games with way more content, which is why I can't recommend this.",
